{
  "name": "Real Estate Daily Follow-up & Digest — n8n Template",
  "description": null,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-wf2-s01",
      "name": "WHAT THIS WORKFLOW DOES",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Real Estate Daily Follow-up & Digest\n\nRuns every morning at 8 AM. Sends personalized follow-up emails to active leads on days 1, 3, and 5 after first contact. Then emails you a daily digest.\n\n**Pair with:** Real Estate Lead Intake workflow (WF1).",
        "height": 120,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-wf2-s02",
      "name": "SET YOUR SPREADSHEET",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        300,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Set Your Spreadsheet**\n\nConnect your Google Sheets credential and paste the spreadsheet ID in the 'Fetch Active Leads', 'Update Lead Row', and 'Error Log' nodes. Must be the same sheet WF1 writes to.",
        "height": 110,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-wf2-s03",
      "name": "FOLLOW-UP SCHEDULE",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        640,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Follow-up Schedule**\n\nDefault: Day 1 (friendly), Day 3 (value-add), Day 5 (gentle close). Edit the 'Filter Due Leads' Code node to change the max follow-up count (default 3). Leads with 3 follow-ups auto-close.",
        "height": 110,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-wf2-s04",
      "name": "CUSTOMIZE FOLLOW-UP TONE",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1180,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Customize Follow-up Tone**\n\nThree tone templates in 'Build Follow-up Prompt': Day 1 (friendly first touch), Day 3 (new listings value-add), Day 5 (gentle close). Edit the expression values to match your agency voice.",
        "height": 110,
        "width": 370,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-wf2-s05",
      "name": "CONFIGURE DIGEST RECIPIENT",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2500,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Configure Digest Recipient**\n\nSet your own email address in the 'Send Daily Digest' Gmail node (sendTo field). The digest arrives every morning with follow-up count.",
        "height": 110,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-wf2-s06",
      "name": "ERROR BRANCHES",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        300,
        590
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Error Branches**\n\nAPI errors during the follow-up loop are logged but do NOT stop the entire loop - the next lead still gets processed. All errors land in the Error Log sheet.",
        "height": 100,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sched-daily-001",
      "name": "Daily 8 AM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        200,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "gs-fetchleads-002",
      "name": "Fetch Active Leads",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        420,
        300
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "sheet",
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID_HERE"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Master Lead Log"
        },
        "range": "A:F",
        "filtersUI": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "GOOGLESHEETSOAUTH2API_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set-readerror-003",
      "name": "Format Read Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        420,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "re001",
              "name": "timestamp",
              "value": "={{ DateTime.now().toISO() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "re002",
              "name": "workflow_name",
              "value": "Real Estate Daily Follow-up & Digest",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "re003",
              "name": "error_node",
              "value": "Fetch Active Leads",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "re004",
              "name": "error_message",
              "value": "={{ ($json.error && $json.error.message) ? $json.error.message : 'Google Sheets read error' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "re005",
              "name": "input_data",
              "value": "={{ JSON.stringify($json).slice(0,500) }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "code-filter-004",
      "name": "Filter Due Leads",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        640,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const today = DateTime.now().toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd');\nconst allRows = $input.all().map(function(i) { return i.json; });\nconst allActive = allRows.filter(function(r) {\n  return r.status === 'new' || r.status === 'active';\n});\nconst dueTodayLeads = allRows.filter(function(r) {\n  return r.next_followup_date === today\n    && Number(r.followup_count || 0) < 3\n    && r.status !== 'closed'\n    && r.status !== 'unsubscribed';\n});\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    today: today,\n    due_today: dueTodayLeads,\n    due_count: dueTodayLeads.length,\n    total_active: allActive.length\n  }\n}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "if-anydue-005",
      "name": "Any Due Today?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        860,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-any-due",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.due_count }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "code-split-006",
      "name": "Loop Over Items",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1080,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const data = $input.first().json;\nconst today = data.today;\nconst total_active = data.total_active;\nif (!data.due_today || data.due_today.length === 0) {\n  return [];\n}\nreturn data.due_today.map(function(lead) {\n  return { json: Object.assign({}, lead, { today: today, total_active: total_active }) };\n});"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set-fuprompt-007",
      "name": "Build Follow-up Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1300,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "fp001",
              "name": "followup_prompt",
              "value": "={{ Number($json.followup_count) === 0 ? 'Write a brief warm follow-up email to ' + $json.name + ' about their property inquiry. Budget: ' + $json.budget_range + '. First follow-up (1 day after first contact). Friendly, offer to schedule a call or viewing. 3-4 sentences. No lists. Sign off as The Team.' : Number($json.followup_count) === 1 ? 'Write a follow-up email to ' + $json.name + ' adding value - mention the property market moves fast and you have new listings matching their budget of ' + $json.budget_range + '. Under 4 sentences. Not pushy. Sign off as The Team.' : 'Write a gentle final follow-up to ' + $json.name + '. Let them know this will be your last message unless they reach out. Leave the door open warmly. 2-3 sentences max. Sign off as The Team.' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "fp002",
              "name": "followup_subject",
              "value": "={{ Number($json.followup_count) === 0 ? 'Following up on your property inquiry, ' + $json.name : Number($json.followup_count) === 1 ? 'New listings matching your search, ' + $json.name : 'Still here when you are ready, ' + $json.name }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-followup-008",
      "name": "Draft Follow-up Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1520,
        300
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "chatModel": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "simplifyOutput": true,
        "maxTokens": 400,
        "prompt": {
          "messages": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are a helpful real estate assistant. Write warm, professional follow-up emails. Plain text only, no HTML tags."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "={{ $json.followup_prompt }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.7
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "OPENAIAPI_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "OpenAi account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set-aierr-009",
      "name": "Format AI Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1520,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "ae001",
              "name": "timestamp",
              "value": "={{ DateTime.now().toISO() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ae002",
              "name": "workflow_name",
              "value": "Real Estate Daily Follow-up & Digest",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ae003",
              "name": "error_node",
              "value": "Draft Follow-up Email",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ae004",
              "name": "error_message",
              "value": "={{ ($json.error && $json.error.message) ? $json.error.message : 'OpenAI API error after 3 retries' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ae005",
              "name": "input_data",
              "value": "={{ JSON.stringify($json).slice(0,500) }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "gmail-followup-010",
      "name": "Send Follow-up Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
